id.instance: String (TS "c<n>") (not used by this chunk)
num.game: i32 (not used by this chunk; JSON numbers are f64 in patches::js::Json, as JS's)
num.cursor: u32 (not used by this chunk)
map.ordered: IndexMap (patches::js::Object = IndexMap<String, Json>, Catalog = IndexMap<String, Object>)
bag.data: IndexMap<String, serde_json::Value> (not used; raw catalog entries are patches::js::Object to keep key order)
error.style: anyhow::Result with TS's message text in the tools; panic only in naming::slug_prefix_of, where TS threw
null.optional: Option + skip_serializing_if
null.nullable: Option, serialised null
case.json: camelCase via serde rename_all
case.rust: snake_case
state.mut: n/a (no GameState in this chunk)
rng.source: n/a (no randomness in this chunk)
hook.style: n/a
registry.style: n/a (reads jackioh_cards::catalog_json/catalog_version only)
async.style: none
log.style: stdout via println!, errors via main's eprintln of the anyhow chain; no tracing
json.order: own order-keeping JSON value (crate::patches::js::Json), since serde_json has no preserve_order
regex.style: hand matchers per TS regex, TS pattern kept in the doc comment (no regex crate)
paths.root: crate::patches::repo_root() = CARGO_MANIFEST_DIR/../..; data under crates/cards/
